	quest.5B11C5DCED53DE14.quest_desc: [
		"&6&lEx Deorum&r&7 是本整合包的核心。两种工具，就能炼出整张元素周期表。"
		""
		"&e&l锤子"
		"&7手持工具徒手破坏方块。原石变为砾石，砾石变为沙子，沙子变为沙粒。"
		""
		"&e&l筛子（THE SIEVE）"
		"&7Right click a sieve while holding dirt, gravel, sand or dust. Out come seeds, ores and clay. A sieve does nothing until you put a &a&lmesh&r&7 in it."
		""
		"&e&lMESH LADDER"
		"&f&lString &8> &7&lFlint &8> &f&lIron &8> &6&lGolden &8> &b&lDiamond &8> &8&lNetherite"
		""
		"&7Every mesh unlocks new drops &oand&r&7 improves the odds of everything below it. &c&lSome ores only ever come out of the netherite mesh."
		""
		"&7&oEx Compressum 会在你有电力后添加自动锤和自动筛。你肯定需要这两个。"
	]
