	quest.6E1C82BF070B12BB.quest_desc: ["在&a&l黑暗之塔&r&7顶部、&a&l黑暗卷轴&r&7前，或是在&a&l水之塔&r&7顶部、&a&l水之卷轴&r&7前，右键点击&7&d&lKubfu&r&7，使其进化为&a&lUrshifu Single&r&7/&a&lRapid Strike Style&r&7。"]
	quest.6E1C82BF070B12BB.title: "进化还是捕捉"
	quest.6E8A1FA1C6EA2AE6.quest_desc: [
		"&7银色是&n中阶&r&7球的金属：&9Great&7、&3Dive&7、&eFast&7、&dLove&7、&bNet&7及其他水阶球。"
		""
		"&6&l所有像素宝可梦矿石的出处&r"
		"&7它们没有一个会生成在空岛，所以全部&f七种原矿&7都加到了&6Ex Deorum&7筛子里："
		"&7- &f砾石&7 -> &7银&7、&f铝土矿&7、&b铂金&7（稀有）、&f卵石&7（稀有）"
		"&7- &f沙子&7 -> &f硅&7、&b天空翻滚石&7（稀有）"
		"&7- &8Crushed Deepslate&7 -> &7Silver&7, &fBauxite&7, &fSilicon&7, &bPlatinum&7"
		"&7- &8Crushed Blackstone&7 -> &8Black Tumblestone&7 (稀有)"
		""
		"&7Metals go to a &ffurnace&7; the three tumblestones to a &f&lstonecutter&r&7. The nine &6Hisui&7 balls and the &fOrigin Ball&7 had NO source at all before this."
		""
		"&e&l提示：&r &7三个锭能做 &f5个底座&7，每个球需要一个底座。银会最先耗尽——派个仆从去采集吧。"
	]
	quest.6E8A1FA1C6EA2AE6.quest_subtitle: "&7精灵球的金属部分"
	quest.6E8A1FA1C6EA2AE6.title: "&7&l银锭"
	quest.6EB06C7C3CF7DC32.quest_desc: ["&7A Meteorite is an item that can change a &d&lDeoxys&r&7's form when used on the &d&lDeoxys&r&7. It can only be used on a &d&lDeoxys&r&7 owned by the player using the Meteorite. The Meteorite can be used an infinite number of times to change a &d&lDeoxys&r&7's form."]
